SUMMARY:Home Made Cheese Making Class
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make gourmet cheeses right from your own home! This class will be a hybrid (virtual and in person). The virtual class will focus on the history of cheese making\, equipment and tools needs\, how to know if your cheese is ready\, and much more. Then we will meet to apply what you’ve learned by making four cheeses which you can take home and enjoy!
URL:https://demo.theeventscalendar.com/event/home-made-cheese-making-class/
CATEGORIES:Cooking Class
